### Team Task Tracker API - Complete Requests (Phase 1 & Phase 2)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api

### ==========================================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================================================

### 1.1 Register Admin User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Admin",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 1.2 Register Member User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob Member",
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "member"
}

### 1.3 Login Admin (sets @accessToken and @refreshToken)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store admin tokens from login response:
@accessToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.refreshToken}}

### 1.4 Login Member (for testing member permissions)
# @name loginMember
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

@memberToken = {{loginMember.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1.5 Refresh Access Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 1.6 Get Current User Profile (GET /api/auth/me/)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ==========================================================================
### 2. TEAMS ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================================================

### 2.1 Create a Team (Admin Only)
# @name createTeam
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Engineering Alpha",
  "description": "Core product development team"
}

### Store created team ID
@teamId = {{createTeam.response.body.id}}

### 2.2 List User's Teams (Teams where current user is a member)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2.3 Get Team Details (Full member list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2.4 Invite Member to Team (Admin + Team Member Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/invite/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.com"
}


### ==========================================================================
### 3. TASKS ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================================================

### 3.1 Create Task in Team
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/tasks/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build Auth Flow",
  "description": "Implement JWT login and register views",
  "status": "pending"
}

### Store created task ID
@taskId = {{createTask.response.body.id}}

### 3.2 List Tasks of Team (Optional ?status=pending filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/tasks/?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3.3 List All Tasks of Team (No filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/tasks/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3.4 Get Task Details by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3.5 Update Task (Status Change logs: '<name> changed status of "<title>" to <Pending / In Progress / Done>.')
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 3.6 Update Task Title and Description
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build Complete Auth Flow",
  "description": "Include refresh token handling and logout"
}


### ==========================================================================
### 4. COMMENTS ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================================================

### 4.1 Add Comment to Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Initial PR is up for review!"
}

### 4.2 List Comments for Task (Oldest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ==========================================================================
### 5. ACTIVITY LOG ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================================================

### 5.1 View Team Activity Timeline (Newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/activity/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
